Well, that's another year.  ;-)

The new Trophy system seems to be quite a bit more interesting than the old,
and we did manage to finish getting the new scoreboard written, if only slighly
more than an hour before the Tournament closed.

With several returning admin volunteers (particularly, Matt, Kevin, Joe and the
Modeemi Ry computer club) we had 6 servers, in 3 countries though only on 2
continents.  We logged a total of 12,453 games played by 529 players, with 168
ascensions.

I want to thank all the server admins: the returning volunteers above and this
year's new guys, Chris from Alberta and Andy from Minnesota (as well as
visi.com, the ISP Andy works for), and Jukka and aardvaark for their patches as
wll as eit_krog and Chris for helping build the new scoreboard.

We want to thank all of you for participating; as I've said here before, we
probably have as much fun putting this on every year as anyone does playing in
it.  ;-)

Thank you,
-robin

